{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_updateasync", "label": "dd.updateAsync", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Wendet lokal an, schickt an die Gossip-Schicht und wartet dann auf Bestaetigungen der konfigurierten Anzahl Replikas. Ein Timeout macht den lokalen Write nicht rueckgaengig - der Wert ist bereits angewandt und gossipt weiter; der Reject signalisiert nur Unsicherheit ueber die Anzahl Replikas innerhalb der Deadline."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_getasync", "label": "dd.getAsync", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fragt andere Replikas nach ihrer Sicht, merged die Antworten und gibt den gemergten Wert zurueck. Ein Majority Read sieht mindestens jeden Majority-bestaetigten Write. Nicht jeden Read quorumen - das hebelt das Local-First-Design aus."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_maxpendingquorumrequests", "label": "maxPendingQuorumRequests", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cap (Default 1000) auf gleichzeitig offene Quorum-Requests; updateAsync und getAsync teilen sich das Budget, 0 deaktiviert. Ueber dem Cap lehnt der Call sofort mit einem Fehler ab, der das Setting beim Namen nennt - er wird nicht eingereiht. Der Cap begrenzt nicht die Queue (die Mailbox des Replikators ist unbounded), sondern die Menge offener Requests, von denen jeder ein Promise, einen Timer und ein Ziel-Set am Leben haelt; ohne ihn laufen die bei einer Partition gemeinsam als Timeout-Sturm ab."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_maxquorumtimeout", "label": "maxQuorumTimeout", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Obergrenze in ms (Default 30000) fuer das timeoutMs eines Calls; ein groesserer Wert wird heruntergeschnitten, 0 deaktiviert. Das Per-Call-Default-Timeout ist feste 5 Sekunden (DEFAULT_ASK_TIMEOUT_MS), unabhaengig vom Gossip-Intervall."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_quorum_metrics", "label": "Quorum-Metriken des Replikators", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Vier Serien mit festen Label-Mengen: quorum_pending (Gauge), quorum_timeouts_total, quorum_rejected_total (je operation=write|read) und dropped_values_total. Steigendes rejected_total heisst, Aufrufer laufen dem Cap davon; steigendes dropped_values_total heisst, ein Peer schickt nicht dekodierbare CRDT-Payloads - ein kaputter oder feindlicher Peer, kein Tuning-Problem."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_quorum_is_not_linearizability", "label": "Majority ist nicht Linearisierbarkeit", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein Majority Write plus Majority Read gibt keine vollstaendig linearisierbare Semantik: nebenlaeufige Writes mergen weiter nach CRDT-Regeln, Majority garantiert nur, dass genug Replikas Bescheid wissen. Quorum ist ausserdem im-Moment - aendert sich die Up-Member-Menge waehrend des Calls, kann das Kriterium voruebergehend unerfuellbar sein. all ist sproede, weil eine einzige langsame Replika die Operation scheitern laesst."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_updateasync", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_overview_consistency_levels", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_getasync", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_overview_consistency_levels", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_updateasync", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_getasync", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_updateasync", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_maxpendingquorumrequests", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_getasync", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_maxpendingquorumrequests", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_updateasync", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_maxquorumtimeout", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_maxpendingquorumrequests", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_quorum_metrics", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_quorum_is_not_linearizability", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_updateasync", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_updateasync", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_replication_gossip_replication", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_updateasync", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_non_fits", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_getasync", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_counters_pncounter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_maxquorumtimeout", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_ask_pattern_asktimeouterror", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_quorum_reads_writes_updateasync", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_durable_storage_withdurablestore", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/quorum-reads-writes.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}], "hyperedges": []}